## Interface: 120007, 120100, 120105
## Title: MiliUI Shopping List
## Title-zhTW: |cffFFFF99[清單]|r 米利的採購清單
## Title-zhCN: |cffFFFF99[清单]|r 米利的采购清单
## Notes: A shopping list for professions. Add a recipe from the profession window or from a crafting order, say how many you want to make, and the reagents multiply along with it.|n|nThe list shows what is still missing — bags and bank counted separately — and at the auction house it searches for those reagents and buys them, always behind an explicit confirmation.|n|n|cffffd200Usage: |r/mlist opens the list, /mlist config opens the settings.
## Notes-zhTW: MiliUI Shopping List|n|n米利的採購清單。|n|n專業用的採購清單：從製作頁或代工下單頁把配方加進清單，指定要做幾份，材料需求跟著相乘。|n|n清單會算出還缺什麼（背包與銀行分開列），到拍賣場可以直接搜尋、確認後購買——花錢一律要按確認。|n|n|cffffd200使用方法: |r/mlist 開啟清單，/mlist config 開啟設定。
## Notes-zhCN: MiliUI Shopping List|n|n米利的采购清单。|n|n专业用的采购清单：从制作页或代工下单页把配方加进清单，指定要做几份，材料需求跟着相乘。|n|n清单会算出还缺什么（背包与银行分开列），到拍卖行可以直接搜索、确认后购买——花钱一律要按确认。|n|n|cffffd200使用方法: |r/mlist 打开清单，/mlist config 打开设置。
## Category: Auction House
## Category-zhTW: 拍賣
## Category-zhCN: 拍卖
## Author: Mili
## Version: 1.0.0
## X-Website: https://github.com/MiliUIPackage/MiliUI
